        "detailed_description": "<h1>Join The Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985400/extras/d226a08c0505565dfae0ca0e0111fc2b.avif?t=1777454360\" width=1560 height=460 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ski Jumping World Cup takes players to the world’s most iconic ski jumping hills, offering competition in both single player modes and online matches against opponents from around the globe. Feel the adrenaline of ski jumping as you compete on 18 varied hills, take part in World Cup, or create your own tournament tailored to your preferences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985400/extras/16b7d4e9edba80024f98218ee78a62d5.poster.avif?t=1777454360\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985400/extras/16b7d4e9edba80024f98218ee78a62d5.webm?t=1777454360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985400/extras/16b7d4e9edba80024f98218ee78a62d5.mp4?t=1777454360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push yourself in competitive tournaments, sharpen your technique in practice mode, or challenge players worldwide in thrilling online duels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision. Nerves. Flight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Ski Jumping World Cup - where every jump matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985400/extras/7904f317c8f2cd4c0873243224a41faa.poster.avif?t=1777454360\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985400/extras/7904f317c8f2cd4c0873243224a41faa.webm?t=1777454360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985400/extras/7904f317c8f2cd4c0873243224a41faa.mp4?t=1777454360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied gameplay modes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Start with the tutorial, refine your skills in training mode, then show your full potential in World Cup competitions or create your own tournament featuring selected hills and a custom number of participants.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 hills</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Compete on the most recognizable ski jumping venues, including 5 illuminated hills available in an additional night mode.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced physics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Control your jumper during flight, fight the wind and aim for the best results.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer Modes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Challenge other players in online multiplayer or in the classic hot seat mode.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive Atmosphere</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dynamic weather, realistic wind conditions, and detailed visuals recreate the intensity and beauty of ski jumping.</i></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ski Jumping World Cup takes players to the world’s most iconic ski jumping hills, offering competition in both single player modes and online matches against opponents from around the globe. Feel the adrenaline of ski jumping as you compete on 18 varied hills, take part in World Cup, or create your own tournament tailored to your preferences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985400/extras/16b7d4e9edba80024f98218ee78a62d5.poster.avif?t=1777454360\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985400/extras/16b7d4e9edba80024f98218ee78a62d5.webm?t=1777454360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985400/extras/16b7d4e9edba80024f98218ee78a62d5.mp4?t=1777454360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push yourself in competitive tournaments, sharpen your technique in practice mode, or challenge players worldwide in thrilling online duels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision. Nerves. Flight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Ski Jumping World Cup - where every jump matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985400/extras/7904f317c8f2cd4c0873243224a41faa.poster.avif?t=1777454360\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985400/extras/7904f317c8f2cd4c0873243224a41faa.webm?t=1777454360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985400/extras/7904f317c8f2cd4c0873243224a41faa.mp4?t=1777454360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied gameplay modes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Start with the tutorial, refine your skills in training mode, then show your full potential in World Cup competitions or create your own tournament featuring selected hills and a custom number of participants.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 hills</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Compete on the most recognizable ski jumping venues, including 5 illuminated hills available in an additional night mode.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced physics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Control your jumper during flight, fight the wind and aim for the best results.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer Modes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Challenge other players in online multiplayer or in the classic hot seat mode.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive Atmosphere</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dynamic weather, realistic wind conditions, and detailed visuals recreate the intensity and beauty of ski jumping.</i></p>",
        "short_description": "Take flight in Ski Jumping World Cup - a true ski jumping adventure that takes you to legendary hills across the globe. From snowy peaks in Scandinavia to wind-swept arenas in Japan and record-breaking runs in the USA, every leap demands focus, precision, and nerves of steel.",
